{"synopsis":"Lahir dari darah iblis dan elf, seorang anak yang dibebani oleh harapan luar biasa melangkah berani ke medan perang yang dipenuhi kehancuran dan kebangkitan. Didorong oleh obsesi yang tak tergoyahkan, ia menembus sungai lava yang mendidih, menghancurkan alam es abadi, dan bertarung di padang tandus tanpa akhir—semua demi satu tujuan: melampaui sosok raksasa yang berdiri jauh di depan. Hingga suatu hari, ketika ia akhirnya menancapkan pedangnya ke tanah dan memandangi keheningan di sekelilingnya, ia mendapati tak ada lagi musuh yang berdiri. Barulah ia menyadari, puncak tak terjangkau yang dulu dikejarnya kini telah berada di bawah kakinya.","alternative_title":"罪恶之城","author":"17k小说网, 烟雨江南","artist":"原点格子漫画, 原点格子","chapters":[{"number":"39","chapter":"39","slug":"8f749ca1-3c1c-4a26-8e36-801c9b3cccce","date":"2026-07-20","images":[]},{"number":"38","chapter":"38","slug":"60c7502f-4ccb-4536-b714-c1c461f58418","date":"2026-07-12","images":[]},{"number":"37","chapter":"37","slug":"7d8fbbca-bc23-4523-bdc0-4aa1911a54f9","date":"2026-07-08","images":[]},{"number":"36","chapter":"36","slug":"3626b81b-938b-4f32-8407-cb79f06c3413","date":"2026-06-26","images":[]},{"number":"35","chapter":"35","slug":"84a37705-77c9-4b76-8caa-194415480e8b","date":"2026-06-23","images":[]},{"number":"34","chapter":"34","slug":"4f4fa004-d743-4714-b1f4-cfb21de7d4f5","date":"2026-06-16","images":[]},{"number":"33","chapter":"33","slug":"53b502c2-cb48-4224-bd0b-df53e81317b5","date":"2026-06-06","images":[]},{"number":"32","chapter":"32","slug":"13e22309-3880-4d21-a0f5-7fdac37d342b","date":"2026-06-01","images":[]},{"number":"31","chapter":"31","slug":"394e9fd2-540d-423c-b866-47daf4ead7a6","date":"2026-05-23","images":[]},{"number":"30","chapter":"30","slug":"ae9b7386-7802-42a0-b880-1cec24113e19","date":"2026-05-17","images":[]},{"number":"29","chapter":"29","slug":"4d29f400-9a32-480c-b338-5dd4fe66c864","date":"2026-05-10","images":[]},{"number":"28","chapter":"28","slug":"a7d24cf6-a416-